{"id":"vod_sn_35624","vodId":"35624","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Z X IGNITION","name_cn":"Z X IGNITION","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/95a3de6c3c79ecb92012ae8530f4327e.jpg"},"summary":"近未来の東京。車は列なり、電車が走り、ひっきりなしに人々が行き交う、何気ない日常の光景が繰り広げられている。街の上空に突如現れる黒い点。その点は見る見る大きさを増していき、街を飲み込んでいく。車も、電車も、そして人々も――。東京は直径数十キロもの黒いドーム、ブラックポイントに覆われた。拡大を止めたブラックポイントの間近。ギリギリ飲み込まれるのを免れたスカイツリーが屹立している。異様な光景を前に呆然としている人々。――と、ブラックポイント中から何かが近づいてくる。いつ果てるとも知れない絶望の中で、人々はブラックポイントより来たりし者を『Zillions of enemy X』、ゼクスと呼んだ―","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e10JyF5edu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uKkmp5WngQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/htf3mWpXpC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u2zgwfJzm81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/05qDPBfRWu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0i4hEbS8Vv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J33gq9w4K11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ipt98S7WJZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w7bc3ksBRz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zny4xuRdr81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4ttw1A0EfP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wWe1vWGkLw1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.892Z"}